+ *
+ * This handler:
+ * 1. Parses form-urlencoded body
+ * 2. Validates token (constant-time)
+ * 3. Checks user allowlist
+ * 4. Checks rate limit
+ * 5. Sanitizes input
+ * 6. Delivers to the agent via deliver()
+ * 7. Sends the agent response back to Synology Chat
